'' Generic constraints (docs/tiko-interfaces §11.6), checked once at each instantiation. Rock has
'' a 'Show' but does not implement IShow -- nominal, not structural -- so ShowIt and Holder refuse
'' it (TKO1022); a constraint naming a type that is no interface is TKO1002, once; a constraint
'' may name its own parameter, and 'long' is no IComparable( of long ). Holder( of IShow ) is
'' clean: the interface itself satisfies its own constraint.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --frontend-only tests/diagnostics/src/iface-constraint-errors.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: iface-constraint-errors.bas(23,13): error TKO1022: type argument 'rock' does not implement 'ishow', which 'showit( of t )' requires
'' EXPECT-OUT: iface-constraint-errors.bas(24,8): error TKO1022: type argument 'rock' does not implement 'ishow', which 'holder( of t )' requires
'' EXPECT-OUT: iface-constraint-errors.bas(15,31): error TKO1002: 'rock' is not an interface
'' EXPECT-OUT: iface-constraint-errors.bas(26,8): error TKO1022: type argument 'long' does not implement 'icomparable( of long )', which 'sorted( of k )' requires
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 4
